// # Ooda CLI — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Front door for the ooda/ product CLI. The 4 subdirs are in-process; main.oo routes argv and spawns opm, lsp, and mcp.
//
// Setup: The 4 subdirs are build, fix, fmt, token. Handlers receive rest (argv after the subcommand). Spawn requires OODACODEX.
//
// Beats:
//   1. The 4 in-process subdirs: build, fix, fmt, token. api_surface=4.
//   2. main.oo is the argv router: in-process subcommands plus 3 spawn entries (opm, lsp, mcp).
//   3. qa/, scripts/, docs/, examples/ are the tactical-subsystem surfaces. No VERSION file.
//   4. Spawn paths are $OODACODEX/bin/<name> only. Compiler path is OODA_COMPILER only.

import "build/ANCHOR.oo";
import "fix/ANCHOR.oo";
import "fmt/ANCHOR.oo";
import "token/ANCHOR.oo";
